<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46861" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡλίκος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>as big
				as</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόσος τις; μικρός, ἡλίκος Μόλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					55
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τοσοῦτον ὕβρισεν, ἡλίκον . .
			</span>; <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.147
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τηλικοῦτος, ἡ. οὐδείς πω βασιλεύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of age, <i>as
				old as</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνδρα . . ἡλίκον Θουκυδίδην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					703
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖσιν ἡλίκοισι νῷν,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τηλίκοις ἡλίκοι νώ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				465
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἡλίκοι</span>
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγώ</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τηλίκοι ἡλίκοι ἐγώ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>La.</u>
				180d
			</span></i>: rare in Trag., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρᾷς μὲν ἡμᾶς,
				ἡλίκοι . . </span>
			<i>of what various ages . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in indirect
			questions, <i>how big, how great</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				23.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Crates Theb.
				18
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρῶν ἡ. ἐστὶ Φίλιππος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					6.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Chrm.</u>
				154b
			</span></i>; freq. in expressions of wonder, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαυμάσι᾽ ἡλίκα</span>
			<i>extraordinarily great</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.24
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαυμαστὸν ἡλίκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					24.122
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέγιστα ἡλίκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			; also, <i>how small</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰδοὺ ἡλίκον πῦρ ἡλίκην ὕλην
					ἀνάπτει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Jac.</u>
					3.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂν ἴδω γὰρ ἡλίκον ἰχθὺν ὅσου
					τιμῶσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					166.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Herm.</u>
				5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> in
			exclamations, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡλίκον λαλεῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Sam.</u>
					40
				</span></i>
			. (Compd. of <i>yo-</i>, relat. Pron. stem (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅς</span>), and <i>-āli-</i> (cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἧλιξ</span>), with suffix <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κο-</span>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηλίκος,
				τηλίκος</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
